# What under assets/ is not content.
#
# Not the same question .gitignore answers. That file says what is not worth
# versioning, and it already excludes models/ and every .spv -- between them most
# of the art and all of the shaders. This file says what has no role in the
# pipeline, so nothing here is minted an id, listed in the browser, or cooked.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore's, with one difference: a directory excluded here is still
# descended into, so a later ! line can take one file back out of it.

# Authoring sources kept beside their output, and the backups a DCC tool leaves
# next to them.
*.blend
*.blend1
*.zip

# Editor-only content. DebugUI draws the spinner and loads the fonts from here
# without checking for an editor, but DebugUI is inside Assisi::Debug, which only
# Assisi::Editor links and which the Game target is forbidden to -- so nothing in
# a standalone build can read any of it.
/editor/
